You were level 30 with a maximum of 594 hit points when you ascended.
(I know *that* is much... but on the UNIX system I use there are ascensions
in the 600-900 hp range... and as I said, I wanted to make sure I have enough
hp).

My intrinsics were telepathy, teleport, teleport control (from a ring -- wasted
two wishes - to cursed genocide and tins - in unsuccessful attempts to get it
from tengu corpses), see invisible, invisibility, very fast, poison res., 
fire res., cold res., sleep res., (but NOT shock resistance), disintegration
res., life saving, warning (THE most useless intrinsic there is - it is merely
annoying/confusing when you are looking for the vibrating square etc.), 
protection (to ac) , reflection, levitation (from a ring), magic-protection
(GDSM) and displacement (the cloak). 

I had died once (eating when satisfied - I wasn't prompted "Stop eating?"), 
but still had 3 AoLSes left when I ascended. 

I had genocided all T's, L's, ;'s and c's. I always dipped the uncursed 
genocide scrolls in holy water to make them blessed. (In 313--, you will also
have to genocide chickatrices, so an uncursed genocide is not enough for 'c').
All in all, 15 species had been genocided. 

I killed Baalzebub, Juiblex, Medusa, Croesus, Pestilence (2 times), the 
Chromatic Dragon and the Wizard of Yendor (12 times). The list shows that I had
killed an archon, but this is actually not true, since it was a peaceful
archon that had got digested by a purple worm (while I was causing conflict).
I never had to fight an archon in this game. A total of 3159 monsters were
killed in the game. 335 of them were wraiths >:-) Btw, what's the maximum
amount of a monster type normally generated in a game? 

I never met any of 313-- new unique monsters.

