A weird thing was that I got the Asmodeus level but never met Asmodeus there or
anywhere else. I wore a towel when I entered the level, and there he was, but
when I reached the place there was not a trace of him. Maybe he realized how
tough I was (I had already -34 AC, 584 HP and the +6 Grayswandir by then) and
wimped out... :-}

Hmmm, what should I try next? Ascend on the UNIX? Ascend a tourist? First,
I think I'll have a little break, though...

